// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2805830027" "Lady Gallant is always telling me how my independence and stubborness have the makings of virtues, but I need to know when to let go. I guess that time is now.<br><br>{HeroName}, I managed to escape my cell, but when I searched for Lady Gallant I could find no trace of her. There appear to be numerous prison wards in this facility, maybe she is in a different one. Will you help me search for her?"
// AcceptString :
"P4231115475" "Search for Lady Gallant"
// SendOffString :
"P4287210141" "Maybe Doctor Keppel can help you locate which prison ward she is held in. I have to stay here to make sure Dr. Keppel and his staff aren't torn apart by the Clockwork. If you find Lady Gallant I'll be here waiting."
// TaskTitle :
"P3969029552" "<color deepskyblue>A Squire's Charge</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

