"P3952385569" "Speak with Doctor Keppel"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3149937469" "Have you spoken with Doctor Keppel yet? I'm sure he'll be able to help you locate what prison ward Lady Gallant is held in."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2816649781" "You want to know what prison ward a specific prisoner is being held in?<br><br>Why of course we can do that! Well... Er, I guess that's going to be a trifle bit more difficult since the clockwork have severed the data lines between the various work stations and the central network.<br><br>If you could access the network directly, though, then it wouldn't be any trouble at all. There is a console that will give you access in a nearby building. Be careful though, the Clockwork will be guarding such equipment fiercely.<br><br>Good luck, {HeroName}."

