// IntroString :
"P3987007604" "Well, according to the information you accessed from the central computer, it looks like Lady Gallant is being held in Ward 11.<br><br>I really want to go and get her myself, but, I have to admit, I barely escaped the prison ward myself. You seem to be able to handle the Clockwork just fine, maybe you should go... that is, if you don't mind, erm, volunteering?"
// AcceptString :
"P3163690534" "Find Lady Gallant"
// SendOffString :
"P3226380548" "You must think I'm the worst sidekick ever, huh?<br><br>Well, thanks for giving me a hand. I suppose I am still doing something worthwhile by staying here to make sure Dr. Keppel and his staff aren't torn apart by the Clockwork. I'll be here waiting.<br><br>Good luck, {HeroName}, and thanks!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2896708787" "Have you had any luck finding Lady Gallant?"
