// Dialog :
"P2588998616" "Outside of the Enclosure!? Why would she do that, the place is crawling with the devouring earth! We have to save her!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2519702724" "Lady Gallant must have had a reason to leave the Enclosure, I just don't know what that reason is. The only sensible thing to do is focus on finding her.<br><br>{HeroName}, I'm not strong enough to fight off the devouring earth and those scientists still need my protection. It only makes sense for you to go look for Lady Gallant, I will wait here as she requested and fulfill my duty."
// SendOffString :
"P2762302498" "Please find Lady Gallant, {HeroName}. She's the closest thing to family I have."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2588519693" "Lady Gallant hasn't returned, she must still be out in the forest, searching for who knows what. Please find her."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1224468182" "<color deepskyblue>Finale</color>"

