// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2505318645" "The sad deed is done. Return to Scarlet Squire and present her with her heirloom, Lady Gallant's magic sword, Paramour."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1489652983" "De... Dead!?<br><br>No... Why? How?<br><br>...<br><br>I see. Paramour is now my duty to carry, my honor. I wish only to have known what impulse drove Lady Gallant into those woods. But it is probably best I leave that a secret only known to Paramour.<br><br>Thank you {HeroName}, your efforts have left Lady Gallant's name untarnished, and returned Paramour to the hands of the just and righteous. I still have much to learn before I can ever hope to equal her, but with Paramour as my guide, I do not fear the path that lies ahead."
// RandomFameString :
"P3255997084" "I heard {HeroName} fulfilled Lady Gallant's dying wish."

